From 09cb8e92305308449abc2619020469045ad7edc1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stanislav Aleksandrov <lightofmysoul@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Mar 2026 07:56:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] XR: OpenXR: Add async rendering support for OpenXR
 backend

Optional multithreaded rendering for the OpenXR backend, controlled by
QT_QUICK3D_XR_ASYNC_RENDER=1

Works with both multiview and non-multiview rendering. For multiview,
the full render pass runs async. For non-multiview stereo, all eyes
except the last render synchronously on the worker while the main
thread is blocked; the last eye's render + endFrame runs while the
main thread is free.

Change-Id: I7936cec74a61617720ecc824e118636d1dad369f
